  Canonical ./build.ps1 --configuration=Release --spirv=true passed without those test process settings.
  Tested/published/packaged runtime SHA-256: 598C3AFEC11F20988FA78B00E772EDEAA53E4A8C7AA4E2FCFA9C6D5A71150735.
  All 761 packaged SPIR-V files match both canonical producer and tested assets; dependency hashes
